# Wipeout Pure's pause screen over a Time Trial on Vineta K (Feisar, Vector), played through our own menus the way the original is
# walked (SINGLE PLAYER, TIME TRIAL, Vector, Alpha, Vineta K, the team): START pauses the race and opens the disc's own
# `InGame Main Menu`. `@OUT@` is the screenshot path and `@TICKS@` the race ticks to play, which `compare_menu.drive_command` and
# `psp-menu-pair.py` fill in. Run with `--original-menu` (no PHOTO MODE row) and `--no-intro`.
boot
select campaign; press cross; ticks 40
press down; ticks 10; press down; ticks 10; press cross; ticks 40
press cross; ticks 40
press cross; ticks 40
press cross; ticks 40
press cross; ticks 40
until stage=race within 6000
ticks @TICKS@
press start
ticks 10
draw
screenshot @OUT@
quit
